('pmbrmbe_0076', 'pmbrmbe', '0076', '76', 'PMBR Early Bird MBE 2007', 'Torts', '76', '', 'Tom’s fireworks startled a horse, causing rider to fall.', '(A) Tom is liable if negligent.', '(B) Tom is strictly liable.', '(C) Tom is not liable if fireworks were legal.', '(D) Tom is not liable unless warned.', 'A', '', 'pmbrmbe_0076', 0, NULL),
