('pmbrmbe_0078', 'pmbrmbe', '0078', '78', 'PMBR Early Bird MBE 2007', 'Torts', '78', '', 'Joy left her baby unattended in a car, child suffered heatstroke.', '(A) Joy is liable for negligence.', '(B) Joy is not liable if child was asleep.', '(C) Joy is strictly liable.', '(D) Joy is not liable if accident was unforeseeable.', 'A', '', 'pmbrmbe_0078', 0, NULL),
